      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Milagi' ku'nguno ya myanya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘I'zi hu' nsiku' zya myanya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, i'zyo mulazitangazye ku'v'a nkuti'la nsondo. I'zi hu' zyene natu'u'lile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'lav'e na nsiku' mukaga zya ku'tu'mama mili'mo, ali'vi lu'siku' lwa mupungati' lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho na nkuti'la nsondo. Ku'du' mwize mutu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo. Yeni'yo yi'li' Sabato nsondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu mugati' na wikalo winywe wose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘I'zi hu' nsiku' zya myanya zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu i'zyo mulav'ezye nkuti'la nsondo, i'zyo mulatangazye ku' itungo i'lo li'tu'u'lilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na ine lwa mwezi gwa kwandya, Pasaka yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu yi'lav'e yi'li'lamula mpi'ndi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na itano lwa mwezi gwenu'go gwa kwandya, gu'lav'e gu'li'lamula Mwanya gwa Migate i'zyo Zikatumba ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Yi'li'mudima ku'lya migate zyeni'zyo ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwa kwandya mulav'ezye nkuti'la nsondo. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo ku'du' mwize mutu'mame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' nsiku' zyeni'zyo mupungati' mulamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya. Lu'siku' lwa mupungati' mulav'ezye hangi' nkuti'la nsondo, na ku'du' mwize mutu'mame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli, ‘Aho mulav'e mwafika mu nsi' i'yo namupile na kwi'mbu'la viliwa vya nsi' yeni'yo, ki'la yu'mo alamuletele muhozya isapali lya ntomolwa ya lyi'mbu'la lya kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' lwav'i'ta lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, lu'siku' u'lo lu'lalonde nawe alawu'sye isapali lyeni'lo mu igu'lya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'gele li'zumiwe ku'nguno yinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwenu'lo lwa ku'wu'sya isapali, yi'lamudime ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo cha ku'zigya cha kadi'lana ka nkolo ka mwaka gu'mo, ako kali' wu'du'hu' wu'lema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haki'mo na ki'taambo cheni'cho, mulafumye na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, kilo iv'i'li' zya wu'fuma wu'nelezu u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe na maguta ga muzeituni, ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. Hangi' mulapu'ngu'li'le kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'neneko nsu'pa yi'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' mwize mulye ki'liwa cha mu mugu'nda, ki'v'e ki'toto, cha ku'kalangwa, ninga migate, u'lu' mukaali' ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Mulungu winywe. Yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, mu wikalo winywe wose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'fumi'i'la lu'siku' lwa ku'londa ki'suuho, lu'siku' u'lo ndi' mwaleta isapali lya ku'wu'siwa ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo, mulav'azye mayuma mupungati'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lu'siku' lwa ku'londa ki'suuho cha yuma ya mupungati', yaani lu'siku' lwa maku'mi atano, mulafumye kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo mpya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la mugana mugati' na wikalo winywe, gu'lalete migate iv'i'li' i'zyo ziv'eziv'ilwe ku' wu'fuma wu'nelezu kilo iv'i'li' u'wo wu'li' na itumbyo, viwu'siwe ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo mpya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haki'mo na migate zyeni'zyo, mulafumye tu'di'lana twa nkolo mupungati' twa mwaka gu'mo u'to tu'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema, nzagamba na ng'ondi iv'i'li'. Vyeni'vi vilav'e vitaambo vya ku'zigya vya ku'mufumi'zya Mulungu, haki'mo na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo na ki'neneko, ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya kav'e wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' mulafumye ngulati' yi'mo ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na tu'di'lana tu'v'i'li' twa ng'ondi twa mwaka gu'mo ku'v'a vitaambo vya kwiswanania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe muhozya alaviwu'sye haki'mo na i'zyo migate ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, haki'mo na u'to tu'di'lana tu'v'i'li'. Kali' kalu'mbi'lo kasondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, navyo vilav'e vya muhozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwene lu'lo mulatangazye nkuti'la nsondo. Ku'du' mwize mutumame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose. Yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, mu wikalo winywe wose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
