            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Lu'siku' lwa kwandya lwa mwezi gwa mupungati' lu'lav'e lwa ku'lenda, na nkuti'la nsondo na ku'tangazya mwizu' ku' ku'fuula milangale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' mwize mutu'mame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose, sumbwa mulafumye kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi lwa mwezi gwenu'go gwa mupungati' lu'li' Lu'siku' lwa Wu'swanano. Mulav'e na nkuti'la nsondo, na ku'hangamyoyo, na inywe mulamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwenu'lo ku'du' mwize mutu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo, ku'nguno lu'lav'e Lu'siku' lwa Wu'swanano, ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yinywe ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' u'yo alaleke ku'hangamoyo lu'siku' lwenu'lo, yi'lamudime akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo alatu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo lu'siku' lwenu'lo ndamuzimangu'zye ku'fuma mugati' na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' mwize mutu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo. Yeni'yi' yi'li' nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, mu wikalo winywe wose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwenu'lo lu'lav'e lwa ku'lenda na ku'hangamyoyo. Ku'lamuli'la mpi'ndi' ya lu'siku' lwa kenda lwa mwezi mpaka wangalu'ke mpi'ndi', mulalu'dime lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho chinywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
